⍝ The datamunge GNU APL console (just repl-apl): apl with datamunge.apl loaded (the dm∆ functions;
⍝ DATAMUNGE_APL_LIBRARY names the native library). Leave with )OFF.
'datamunge loaded (GNU APL, dm∆ functions); try:'
'      DF←dm∆data∆iris'
'      dm∆DataFrame∆nrows DF'
'      ⍞←DF dm∆DataFrame∆to_string 5'
'      dm∆seql 0 1 5'
'      ⎕CR ''dm∆seql''          ⍝ the documentation'
'      dm∆Delete DF'
